  "ruleText": "Env-Wr 504.05 Preventive Action. Section 3 of the EAP shall:\n\n(a) Indicate actions that the owner or designee shall take to operate the dam or to address or correct a malfunction of the dam;\n\n(b) Identify the means, materials, and equipment needed to address anticipated malfunctions or make emergency repairs to the dam;\n\n(c) Identify the necessary equipment, including alternative power sources, to operate the dam’s outlet works or other essential components; and\n\n(d) Include any other preventive and mitigative action measures to be undertaken during emergency situations.\n\nSource. #1716, eff 2-20-81; ss by #2207, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2900, eff 11-7-84; ss by #4534, eff 11-30-88; ss by #5080, eff 2-22-91; ss and moved by #6462-B, eff 2-21-97 (formerly Env-Wr 506.05); ss by #8285, INTERIM, eff 2-21-05, EXPIRES: 8-20-05; ss by #8414, eff 8-20-05; ss by #10510, eff 1-22-14; ss by #13980, eff 5-24-24 (formerly Env-Wr 505.05)",
